        "TileImage": "$($repository eceef7f6-d43d-4435-a088-0c686cf202dc).Image",
        "Description": "We have intel about more syndicates from loners. They are involved in human trafficking. They are putting gps trackers into cakes and hunting them down. They are now in USA Whittetlon Creek and are giving their targets cupcakes with trackers. Eliminate them and dont get spotted. Good Luck 47.",
